<description>&lt;p&gt;Armed clashes have spread to Yaounde, Douala and Maroua as Cameroonian security forces confront Ambazonian separatists, extending fighting beyond the traditional Northwest and Southwest battlegrounds. Separatist attacks continue in the Anglophone regions ten years after the crisis began, while UNESCO has joined national efforts to prevent femicide in Cameroon. The Cameroon Senate President denied social media rumours of an assassination attempt against him. Metal Shark is building patrol boats for Cameroon, indicating a focus on maritime security. The conflict recorded 231 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMimgFBVV95cUxPLW93ZFRQNG1CektwTG1UVEVMdDRRbmRQNVUwWlQyUHFkVVpRVHhwZ19DQlZRZW1JT3dhbllFZi1fMXA5a1FxSVc0U25XOENXNy1KOUI2T05iWHBXY2V6MkFCWGVOaU5nT3I4eklpTVd5cXlyRGRUQ3BZQllzV01XZW1jRU5LWGtHUTgwd3Q4QTNVNVV4dEc2SGdB?oc=5&quot;&gt;DW.com&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;7NEWS&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMimgFBVV95cUxOWVRobkdDTTZheUZ5QmYxTHl0NjkzU0F0c1BIMXVEUXF4dnNFUkphR21HMlJjdG03Nk1EUjlFd2drbUN0dlhJZ3BGcThHVHowNUt2UU05NWlHNnkxZk0zZGRNTzctMVN0MXVDRVdkZkpmWDVuN3FJSDNaajlVZzhoN0lPR2l1QUZZS3BEM0RfbXNwZTJCb0ZVbDVn?oc=5&quot;&gt;New Telegraph&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;News24&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMimAFBVV95cUxObXJLbU52c0taUWlyR2hwUU1kWGZXSFNabUl1UW5NMnpLam1VZ1RDR1hrYU5wTFBwVi1HT2dMNHVQMmxQV0trZXBDOFBMMDI3VVk1N2NsM19MdzBuY1BQVnk5S1htTm52ZjV1SVFhVWtPV25kTWYyODQtXzdPWkNOaVA3Qk5RYmFSQXE5OXlFY1VNQzRDQ3pwQw?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Maritime Executive&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiUEFVX3lxTE9YNlpBX2lqV05EcFdvSWZkdVZLalhfdzhQWGZ0WF9MTjJoc0hVWW02eXFGUGQtTE5ob2lDN3V4SXR0WGp6